{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.poster.avif?t=1761352210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.webm?t=1761352210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/3c0d99997f5b85f2d39448caeb8596ec.mp4?t=1761352210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s take a break from AAA chaos, try this silly and quirky fox game instead!<br>  <br><strong>Chill Fox</strong> is a small, silly, and fun stealth game where you play as a clever fox with a <br>mission to steal chickens and eggs from a quiet countryside farm. There\u2019s no timer, just <br>take your time, explore the beautiful surroundings, and enjoy the laid-back vibes.       <br>  <br>    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t let the calm fool you! Two guard dogs are always on the lookout. Stay sharp Fox!  <br>              </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten golden eggs are scattered across the area, each one is worth five hens. Find them all! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And whatever you do\u2026 don\u2019t forget the elephant. He deserves his freedom too! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905590/extras/5ca84481297f2c38dbf3f2c06b9ffe3c.avif?t=1761352210\" width=600 height=350 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just Vibin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905590/6a78f79866439d57a1f0d52514f0b6ecb0598c0e.jpg"},{"name":"Chicken